Package: MFGP
Type: Package
Title: Multi-Fidelity Gaussian Process Modeling
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-07-28
Author: Generated from Ch04-06-03
Maintainer: MFGP Authors <mfgp@example.com>
Description: Implements the multi-fidelity Gaussian process model of
    Tuo et al. (2014) with the non-stationary kernel of Gu et al. (2018).
    Models y(x,t) = phi(x) + delta(x,t) as a sum of two independent GPs,
    where phi(x) uses a stationary anisotropic Gaussian kernel and
    delta(x,t) uses a non-stationary kernel on the fidelity parameter t.
    Designed for any p-dimensional input x with a continuous fidelity
    parameter t. Uses profile likelihood for estimation and nlminb for
    optimization. No external dependencies beyond base R.
License: GPL-3
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: stats
NeedsCompilation: no
